

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# <type>(<scope>): <T-FF-NNN> <imperative summary, <=72 chars, no full stop>
#
# <body: WHY this change, not what. The diff already says what.>
#
# <footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ... / Refs: ...>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# type   feat fix docs test refactor perf build ci chore revert
# scope  api web db auth domain media forms catalog sdd vault ci deps
#        (optional -- only when it genuinely narrows things down)
#
# Rules:
#   - English. Commit messages are technical artifacts (invariant 4).
#   - Imperative present: "add", not "added" or "adds".
#   - Task ID first in the description when the commit moves a board task.
#   - No Co-Authored-By and no AI attribution of any kind.
#   - One commit, one unit of work. If the summary needs an "and", split it.
#   - Breaking change: `type(scope)!:` or a BREAKING CHANGE footer.
#
# Full convention: docs/vault/99-plantillas/plantilla-commit.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
